PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY

# Exact PNV/1 built-in numeric witness: difference and identity.
# Cannot claim atan2, wrapped-distance, finite-vector-length validation until
# those operations exist as native admitted PNV/PNCS interpreter primitives.
# RELEASE_STATUS BLOCKED_MISSING_NATIVE_NUMERIC_OPERATORS
OP GEOMETRY.A SOURCE 1
OP GEOMETRY.B SOURCE 2
OP GEOMETRY.NUMERIC.DELTA DIFFERENCE GEOMETRY.B GEOMETRY.A
OP GEOMETRY.REFERENCE SOURCE 1
OP GEOMETRY.DELTA.CORRECT IDENTITY GEOMETRY.NUMERIC.DELTA GEOMETRY.REFERENCE
OP GEOMETRY.SEQUENCE ORDER GEOMETRY.A GEOMETRY.B
OP GEOMETRY.EVIDENCE COMPOSITION GEOMETRY.DELTA.CORRECT GEOMETRY.SEQUENCE
ASSERT GEOMETRY.DELTA.CORRECT
EMIT GEOMETRY.EVIDENCE
